# Raw per-run artifacts are NOT committed: they carry absolute local paths and the local Claude Code
# config dump, are bulky, and are fully reproducible from the committed harness + tasks. Only curated
# summaries (results/*.md, e.g. PILOT-R1.md) are tracked.
/results/*/

# Per-run MCP config dropped into worktrees (belt-and-suspenders; worktrees live under /tmp anyway).
.mcp-bench.json
